Greetings, challenger.
My name is Marshal.{VAR BE01}
In order to master the art of fighting,
I'm training under my mentor, Alder.{VAR BE01}
My mentor sees your potential as a
Trainer and is taking an interest in you.{VAR BE01}
It is my intention to test you--to take
you to the limits of your strength. Kiai!{VAR BE01}

Whew! Well done!{VAR BE01}
As your battles continue,
aim for even greater heights!

Representing the Pokémon League in the
absence of the Champion has been my duty{VAR BE00}
as Alder's student.{VAR BE01}
However, there is nothing as empty as
words not backed up by strength.{VAR BE01}
A word in your ear, strong challenger...
The other members of the Elite Four{VAR BE00}
are far more powerful than I am.{VAR BE01}
Do not underestimate them!

Now... You have become the strongest
Trainer in this Pokémon League.{VAR BE01}
The statue in the central chamber will
take you to the Champion's room.{VAR BE01}
We, the Elite Four of Unova,
are sworn to follow the Champion's order{VAR BE00}
to be neutral.{VAR BE01}
So the rest is up to you!

I thank you deeply for the chance for
another round of combat against you.{VAR BE01}
In myself, I seek to develop
the strength of a fighter.{VAR BE01}
And shatter any weakness in myself!{VAR BE01}
Prevailing with the force of
my convictions!{VAR BE01}
Victory, decisive victory, is my intention!
Challenger, here I come!{VAR BE01}

In times past, I wandered all the regions
of the world in pursuit of strength...{VAR BE01}
One day, I met my mentor and began to
grasp the wisdom of making strength{VAR BE00}
an internal quality...{VAR BE01}
And one day, I decided to become part of
the Elite Four of Unova...{VAR BE01}
For some reason, the battle we just had
brought those fateful times back to mind.

The strength shown by you and your
Pokémon has deeply impressed me...{VAR BE01}
Please, continue to the next room
to face the strongest Trainer{VAR BE00}
of the Unova region!
